					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: What was your first guild?</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Shakro</b> on <b>January 19, 2005, 12:09:54 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Mythical Miscreants.&nbsp; Dead and buried for years now.&nbsp; It&#039;s funny, I don&#039;t think you ever can have as much fun as you did with your first family-type guild.&nbsp; Any given night, the whole guild pretty much hung out together.&nbsp; Epic mobs like Phinny and VS were the highlight of our raid experience.</div>
					<br />
