					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Sons of Destiny - it was a low level, small guild that I knew nothing about when I joined.  I think they&#039;re long gone.  Turned out they were mostly European and after a few months I moved on to people in a closer time zone... Stonefist Warriors.  They&#039;re gone except for a few alts.  They merged into Tempest of the Dragons, which is also gone except for a few alts.  I still have the guild leader tag on one of my lowbie alts though.  Anyone want to join?  I make joo an officer!   8)<br /><br />Then I joined Legacy of Storms.  They promptly folded right after I got through their overly long application process.  So I joined Tul Acharn and most recently Union of Power.<br /><br />hmm.... I R a guild killer!   :dissappointed:<br />1) Sons of Destiny (dead)<br />2a) Stonefist Warriors (dead)<br />2b) Tempest of the Dragons (dead)<br />3) Legacy of Storms (dead)<br />4) Tul Acharn (still going, though much smaller than a year ago)<br />5) Union of Power (current)  <br /><br /><br /></div>
