					Post by: <b>Runfassa</b> on <b>January 27, 2005, 08:56:09 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">My first guild was Dragonflyers.  I believe it was the first guild to exist on Rodcet Nife, formed in June &#039;99 I think (it&#039;s been a loooooong time, the memories grow fuzzy, but my guildtag was the first time I ever saw someone with a guildtag).  It became Cascade Point, along with a fair helping of Hawkwood&#039;s.  As the game evolved, a large guild (and Cascade Point at its largest was monstrous by any measure) turned out to be a hindrance, and so Reign of Swords was formed with a focus on progression.<br /><br />In my heart, I consider them all the same guild, as each was formed by some of the same founders.  So in essence, I&#039;ve only been in one guild for my entire time playing.  :)<br /></div>
