					Post by: <b>qismet</b> on <b>February 06, 2005, 06:48:27 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Killy $txt[176] January 21, 2005, 12:19:01 am</div><div class="quote">Non Sibi Sed Patriae<br /></div><br /><br /><br />Woot Non Sib!!!   Hi mom!<br /><br />Went from NSSP to Serene Asylum.  I was in SA for a month or two then went on deployment to the gulf.  When I got back I found myself deguilded and heard SA had broken up, I think I still see some though.  Never felt a connection to SA, I just joined them because a couple of people from NSSP had gone that way.<br /><br />After I got back from deployment I ran into an old NSSP friend in East Karana and learned that Moeh had taken over GL and went back into NSSP and soon became an officer.  I stayued there until I got the phone call from Moeh that NSSP was being disbanded and most peole were going to Tul Acharn. I folowed them to TA.  Then a few months ago I left TA for Inner Loop and am loving it.<br /><br /><br />Oh yeah, and Casta can change his #6 to Inner Loop, good to see you again Casta!</div>
					<br />
